                                <span class="text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs font-mono font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">F10</span>
